# Format and import order

Follow `.prettierrc` (2-space indent, single quotes, `printWidth` 100).

Sort imports with the `eslint` style (`amatiasq.sort-imports`): side-effect imports first, then by import kind, then alphabetically. Match that order when adding imports.
